<title>UK: Thomas the Tank Engine's creator dies.</title>
<headline>Thomas the Tank Engine's creator dies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reverend Wilbert Awdry, creator of the popular children's book character, Thomas The Tank Engine, has died at his home, the BBC reported on Friday.</p>
